<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><title>Referral Portal | Result Vault</title><style>body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f8fafc;color:#1e293b;margin:0}.top{background:#1e3a8a;color:#fff;padding:1rem 1.5rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.top a{color:#fde047;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold}.box{max-width:760px;margin:1.5rem auto;background:#fff;padding:1.5rem;border-radius:0.8rem;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1}input{width:100%;padding:0.7rem;margin:0.35rem 0 0.85rem;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:0.45rem;box-sizing:border-box}button{background:#15803d;color:#fff;border:none;padding:0.8rem 1.3rem;border-radius:0.45rem;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}</style></head><body><div class="top"><strong>NIGERIA PRY &amp; SEC RESULT VAULT — REFERRAL PORTAL</strong><a href="/">Back Home</a></div><div class="box" style="background:#f0fdf4;border-color:#15803d"><h2 style="margin-top:0;color:#1e3a8a">Earn N1,000 Per Student Term or N500 Per School Student!</h2><ul><li><strong>N1,000 Per Unlocked Term:</strong> Share your personal link with parents and earn N1,000 every time their child unlocks a term vault.</li><li><strong>N500 Per Unlocked Term (School Scout):</strong> Introduce a School Proprietor who signs our MOU and earn N500 per term across every student in that school.</li></ul></div><% if(created){ %><div class="box" style="background:#dcfce7;border:2px solid #16a34a"><h3 style="margin-top:0;color:#15803d">Your Referral Link Is Ready!</h3><p>Code: <strong><%= created %></strong></p><input type="text" readonly value="<%= protocol %>://<%= host %>/ref/<%= created %>" onclick="this.select()"></div><% } %><div class="box"><h3 style="margin-top:0;color:#1e3a8a">1. Generate Your Referral Link</h3><form action="/refer/create" method="POST"><input name="fullName" placeholder="Full Name" required><input name="phone" placeholder="WhatsApp Phone Number" required><input name="customCode" placeholder="Preferred Code (e.g. CHUKWUDI)" required><input name="bankName" placeholder="Bank Name (e.g. Zenith, Access, OPay)" required><input name="accountNumber" placeholder="10-Digit Account Number" required><input name="accountName" placeholder="Account Name" required><button type="submit">Generate My Referral Link</button></form></div><div class="box"><h3 style="margin-top:0;color:#1e3a8a">2. Check Your Earnings</h3><form action="/refer" method="GET"><input name="code" value="<%= lookup || '' %>" placeholder="Enter Your Referral Code" required><button type="submit" style="background:#1e3a8a">Check Earnings</button></form><% if(stats){ %><p><strong>Name:</strong> <%= stats.profile.full_name %> | <strong>Paid Terms:</strong> <%= stats.paidTerms %> | <strong>Earned:</strong> N<%= stats.totalEarned.toLocaleString() %> | <strong>Pending:</strong> N<%= stats.pending.toLocaleString() %></p><% } %></div></body></html>
